pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# clock-hz 60
# Base hidden-car reload/drive/view qualification. Use a private seed with
# a natively bought retained variant selected near the Gauntlet, with only
# hidden_cars enabled (remove recommendation/price helper mods).
# Compare the saved CareerCar/garage model and review captures: a route
# pass alone does not prove the intended model, garage entry or paint.
# This drives for eight seconds, then cycles the five camera views.
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 930 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 1400 3000 vehicle
capture 1560 selected-model
input 1680 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
input 2160 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2300 driven-model
input 2360 0200 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2450 camera-1
input 2480 0200 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2570 camera-2
input 2600 0200 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2690 camera-3
input 2720 0200 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2810 camera-4
input 2840 0200 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2846 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2930 camera-5
stop 2970
